# No Strings Attached / Puppetmaster Blues / Achieving True Power sharing Shamarhaan (Bastok Markets) and
# Iruki-Waraki (Whitegate, whose own script offers The Wayward Automaton 774 and is the lookup fallback after an
# Event). Task 8 review lesson: rival containers, each NPC triggered twice. Iruki: NSA 266 (P, Prog 4) with the
# script's accepted Wayward Automaton; NSA completed (the script's 774) with PB 782 (P, Operation Teatime
# completed); NSA 261 (E) with PB 783 (E). Shamarhaan: NSA 434 (P, Option 0) with Achieving True Power 441 (P, PB
# completed); NSA 435 (E) with PB 437 (P) and ATP 442 (E); NSA 435 (E, Option 1) with PB 439 (P) and ATP 442 (E).
